# ==========================================================
# Generated Atlas output — never tracked
# ==========================================================
# Everything under output/ is produced by Atlas scripts and is fully
# rebuildable from source (see RUNBOOK.md). It is deliberately excluded
# wholesale rather than rule-by-rule: new subsystems add new output
# directories, and per-directory rules were always one step behind.
#
# ACF profile sources live here too (output/library/profiles/). They are
# research data, not build output, and are backed up separately — not by Git.
#
# To version a specific fixture, add an explicit negation below.
output/

# Local working artifacts (audit scratch, backups) — not part of the project
backup/
/*.txt
claude-code-day-one-pro-setup.md
